                           Contributing to mnouw

Thank you for your interest in contributing.

All contributions require a Signed-off-by line in every commit message:

    feat: add new feature

    Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>

You can add it automatically:

    git commit -s -m "your commit message"

By signing off, you accept the Contributor License Agreement in the file
"CLA", as certified by the repository DCO. If an employer, client, university,
or other organization owns the work, an authorized representative must accept
the agreement before you contribute.

Projects may have additional technical contribution requirements.
